4481:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  *
4482:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * This function overrides the RPC bits related to weak pull up and
4483:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * weak pull downs. It also sets the override bit if the I/O is disabled.
4484:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * The settings come fro m Libero
4485:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  *
4486:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * Note: If LIBERO_SETTING_RPC_EN_ADDCMD0_OVRT9 is not present, indicates older
4487:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * Libero core (pre 2.0.109)
4488:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * Post 2.0.109 version of Libero MSS core, weak pull up and pull down
4489:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * settings come from Libero, along with setting unused MSS DDR I/O to
4490:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * override.
4491:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  *
4492:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  */
